KeyFirstKeyFirstKeyFirstKeyFirstKeyFirstKeyFirstKeyFirstKey" + count);
        DictionaryMessage val = client.getDictionary(empKey);
        Assert.assertEquals(count, val.getDictionaryValue());
    }
    // Test size function
